{"answer_text":"Use one pipeline per sales motion (new business, expansion, partners), share stage definitions, and report across all of them. Tools that handle multiple pipelines well: [1]\n\n- **Pipewell Flow**: Strong pipeline analytics and rotting-deal alerts that keep reps honest. [2]\n- **Halcyon Sales**: Combines cadences, dialer and pipeline in one place. [3]\n- **Brightdesk**: Better at tickets than at deals. [4]\n- **Calmline**: Doesn't track deals. [5]\n\nIn short, Pipewell is the safest default here; Halcyon Sales is worth a look if forecasting matters most.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50cc-7038-9d8e-196d4f5295fc","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0051,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:02.650Z","engine":"perplexity","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["multiple sales pipelines best practice","crm multiple pipelines reporting"],"latency_ms":4890,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a12333f09a","market_name":"United Kingdom","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889b1141e640","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Pipewell","name_text":"Pipewell","offsets":[[179,187],[458,466]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889c3d4225fd","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Halcyon Sales","name_text":"Halcyon Sales","offsets":[[277,290],[495,508]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889d8a28ba29","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Brightdesk","name_text":"Brightdesk","offsets":[[355,365]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reas